<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61937" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾱο-φόρος</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεωφόρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bearing people</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαοφόρον καθ᾽ ὁδόν</span> on <i>a highway,
				thoroughfare</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.682
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαοφόρου ἐπέβησαν . . κελεύθου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					25.155
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὲρ τῶν μάλιστα
			λεωφόρων</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαοφ-</span>
			) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυλέων</span> over the gates of
			greatest <i>thoroughfare</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.187
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδός</span>), ἡ,
				<i>highway</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς λεωφόρους μὴ βαδίζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pythag.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>VP</u>
				42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				4.17
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Protr.</u>
				21
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ́</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				8.17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεωφόρους πρὸς ἐκτροπάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					881
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαοφ</span>- codd.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεωφόρου</span>
			<i>from the highway</i>, cj. Vater); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἐκ τῆς χώρας λ. εἰς τὴν πόλιν . .
					τεταμένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					763c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				9.2.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				6.184d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.225c
			</span></i>, and 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεώβατος</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεωφόρος, ἡ,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόρνη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Anacr.
				157
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεω</span>- as monosyll. in
		E.l.c.]</div>
